        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Exit 57\n- Organizations: Comedy Central, The Second City Theatre\n- People: Amy Sedaris, Paul Dinello, Stephen Colbert, Jodi Lennon, Mitch Rouse\n- Places: Chicago\n\nFacts:\n- The Second City Theatre opened on December 16, 1959.\n- The Second City Theatre has become one of the most influential and prolific comedy theatres in the world.\n- Exit 57 is a 30-minute sketch comedy series that aired on Comedy Central from 1995 to 1996.\n- The cast of Exit 57 included Amy Sedaris, Paul Dinello, Stephen Colbert, Jodi Lennon, and Mitch Rouse.\n- Amy Sedaris, Paul Dinello, Stephen Colbert, Jodi Lennon, and Mitch Rouse had all previously studied improv at The Second City in Chicago.",
